DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Día de los Muertos at Keller Estate with an evening
  honoring loved ones through music\, food\, culture\, and community. Roote
 d in the traditional Mexican celebration of life and remembrance\, the eve
 nt invites guests to bring photos of departed family and friends to place 
 on a communal altar\, with frames provided. Festive activities\, live musi
 c\, and the atmosphere of a traditional Mexican pueblo will fill the plaza
 \, while authentic Mexican cuisine paired with Keller Estate wines creates
  a warm and memorable gathering. This heartfelt celebration offers a beaut
 iful opportunity to reflect\, connect\, and honor cherished memories toget
 her.
LOCATION:Keller Estate Winery
