 n custom 8.5" x 11" glass frame. No artistic experience? No problem. Wheth
 er you're Picasso or just here for the sesh\, this workshop is all about g
 ood vibes\, great company\, and having fun.\n\nYour ticket includes:\n\n
 🎨 One 8.5" x 11" glass frame to paint and take home\n\n🖌️ All pain
 ts\, brushes\, and art supplies\n\n✨ Easy-to-follow instruction from the
  talented team at Paint \\+ Party Co.\n\n🌿 A CAM goodie bag valued at o
 ver $60\n\n💨 Full access to The Lounge at Mercy\, where you can enjoy y
