DESCRIPTION:New Work by\, Todd Barricklow & Art Moura\n\nOpening: Oct 24\,
  4-6pm\n\nThrough January\, 2027\n\nTodd Barricklow inspired by the classi
 cal amphora as a vessel of culture and utility\, his work continues this t
 radition by depicting\, in narrative tension\, the tools\, machinery\, and
  transportation of our place in time.\n\nArt Moura is a painter and sculpt
 or working with paper\, wood and found materials. Through imagery that is 
 at once tender\, sometimes brutal\, and emotionally raw\, his work embrace
 s the inescapably ephemeral and poignant truths of life.
LOCATION:Hammerfriar Gallery & Custom Framing
URL:https://www.hammerfriar.com/art-gallery
