BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Renaissance Faire at The Rio Nido Roadhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T170000
UID:261017Wc98TtGFKU2iPRDQZkcUZQ
DESCRIPTION:MUSIC • MISCHIEF • MERRIMENT\n\n**Live Music!**\n\n**Rebec
 ca Roudman -** The fiddler of the Faire\n\n**Wren Story Duo -** Minstrels 
 of the Redwoods\n\n**Jordan Walker -** The Wandering Bard\n\n**POTION TRIA
 LS**\n\nYou're invited to submit an original potion recipe. It could be al
 coholic **or** nonalcoholic\, but the winning recipe becomes a **featured 
 Roadhouse cocktail/mocktail.**\n\nMust use reasonably accessible ingredien
 ts\, contain 5–6 ingredients maximum\, and have a Renaissance/fantasy-in
 spired name.\n\nThink names like **Dragon's Breath\, Fairy's Revenge\, The
  Enchanted Grove...etc.**\n\nWe will choose **3–4 finalists** before the
  event.\n\nAt the Faire guests can buy a **Potion Flight** and receive a v
 oting ballot.\n\n**Winner receives cash prize + their potion featured on t
 he Roadhouse cocktail menu.**\n\n**LIVE ACTION FENCING**\n\nHARK! Prepare 
 to witness a breathtaking spectacle of steel and strategy. Step back into 
 the Golden Age of Chivalry as our troupe of master duelists brings the hea
 rt-pounding reality of Renaissance fencing to the live stage. No rehearsed
  dances or scripted fights—this is authentic\, high-speed\, live-action 
 combat where experienced blades cross in real-time clashes of skill and ho
 nor. Find your seat at the list\, choose your champion\, and prepare to be
  spellbound by the flash of the blade!\n\n**ENCHANTED DANCERS OF THE REALM
 **\n\nSeba and dancers from WildCard BellyDance. An enchanting trio of mus
 ic\, movement and merriment.\n\n**PUMPKIN CARVING\, DECORATING & CRAFTS**\
 n\nFun for the whole family! Supplies and pumpkins provided.\n\nGAMES - PH
 OTO BOOTH BACKDROP - TURKEY LEG FEAST - LOCAL VENDING -\n\nCOSTUMES ENCOUR
 AGED!!\n\nAll Ages\n\n$5 Faire Admission
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
