 lls\, Jimmy Reed\, Joseph & Cleome Falcon... recent single: https://orcd.c
 o/7jjvmmx ... "What Does Your Heart Say?" - a Breezy west coast rock\, a h
 opeful idealistic Americana love song duet\, celebrating the new "Stories 
 In The Heart" album\, listen now!: https://orcd.co/5xga7nr\n\nhttps://www.
 BackpOrchEstra.com\n\nThe Wild Premonitions: 7:30-9:30\n\nA never-before s
 ummit of players... an experiment of many genres: Rock\, Blues\, Jazz\, Fu
 nk\, Zydeco... Mike Rinta\, Tim Eschliman\, Roy Blumenfeld\, Kevin Zuffi a
 nd Ian Lamson... players from The Blues Project\, Rhythmtown-Jive\, Louisi
 ana Time Travelers\, Sly Stone\, Commander Cody & His Western Airmen.\n\n4
 64 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA 95476 (707) 935-0660\n\nSongs from all over the 
 map!...\n\nsee also\n\nRoy Blumenfeld: https://bluesproject.net/bios/\n\nh
