 ic West Marin village of Nicasio\, this family-friendly pumpkin patch offe
 rs a wide variety of pumpkins spread across a beautiful meadow\, including
  classic jack-o'-lantern pumpkins\, colorful specialty varieties\, and Cin
 derella-style squash. Families can enjoy hayrides\, farm animals\, and liv
 e music on weekends. The farmstand also offers gourds\, squash\, decorativ
 e cornstalks\, apples\, drinks\, and snacks. Food and refreshments are ava
 ilable on weekends. Admission and Parking: FREE! Pumpkins are priced indiv
 idually\, typically $8-$44. Some activities cost extra. Hours: Monday-Thur
 sday: 10 am-4 pm Friday: 10 am-6 pm Saturday-Sunday: 9 am-6 pm Open daily 
 through Halloween.
