DESCRIPTION:Jimmy Failla’s Escape from New York Tour\, coming to the LBC
  on October 24\, is the comedian’s return to his natural habitat of live
  standup comedy. Long before Fox News gave him a TV show and what he calls
  “some much-needed makeup\,” Jimmy was performing in clubs and college
 s across the country nearly every week of the year. Now he's back on the r
 oad with an hour of new material that puts everyone in the splash zone - p
 oliticians\, celebrities\, and pretty much anybody else who needs a comedy
  beatdown in what Failla refers to as “this funhouse we call America.”
  It's a night of uncensored standup along with an audience Q&A that leaves
  nothing off limits\, including\, he claims\, his famous Fox News friends.
