BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sculpt & Sip with Purpose
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T160000
UID:261015EVgneb3B4UWjNqxMg2GphA
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Bricoleur Vineyards for an afternoon celebrating Br
 east Cancer Awareness Month\, held in honor of our "Sip with Purpose" camp
 aign. We're excited to partner with Social Wellness Society\, Sutter Healt
 h\, Drink DUJU and more to bring you a meaningful afternoon of movement\, 
 connection\, and celebration - all in support of a great cause. 100% of ti
 cket sales will be donated to the V Foundation for Cancer Research\, suppo
 rting life-saving research and giving hope to families everywhere.\n\nThe 
 event will kick off with a 45-minute Pilates and sculpt class led by Justi
 ne Licursi of Social Wellness Society\, setting the tone for an afternoon 
 centered on strength\, wellness\, and community.Following class\, guests w
 ill enjoy a glass of our beloved Isla Rose Brut Rosé while mingling with 
 fellow supporters in the beauty of Bricoleur Vineyards. Hear directly from
  Sarah Citron as she shares her personal journey with breast cancer and th
 e profound impact of the V Foundation's support along the way.This afterno
 on is made even more special thanks to our generous vendor partners: Falli
 ng for Dainty will be on-site selling beautiful jewelry donating 15% of sa
 les to the cause. Sarah with Bloom Event Co has generously donated stunnin
 g florals and Nothing Bundt Cakes has donated delicious desserts for all t
 o enjoy.\n\nEvery guest will also take home a gift bag valued at over $300
  — our way of saying thank you for standing with us in the fight against
  cancer.Come move\, sip\, celebrate\, and support a cause that touches so 
 many of us. Together\, we can make a meaningful difference.\n\nEvent Detai
