DESCRIPTION:Marking the Healdsburg Museum's 50th anniversary\, "Healdsburg
  in the 1970s" pairs bright 1970s nostalgia with community-sourced artifac
 ts and thoughtful stories about rights\, belonging\, land\, and how the de
 cade reshaped Healdsburg.
