DESCRIPTION:On Saturday October 3\, Gallery Route One in Point Reyes Sta
 tion opens three news exhibitions: Bruce Mitchell’s Gravitational Pull
 \, fine-art wood sculpture\; Steven Hurwitz’s abstract multimedia wall c
 onstructions\; and Geoffrey Campen’s Offcut\, mixed-media work based on
  architectural plans\; The public is cordially invited to the opening\, O
 ctober 3\, 3 to 5pm. Meet GRO Artists\, see the show\, and enjoy a glass 
 of wine. Shows run until November 8\, open 11am to 5pm\, Thurs through Mon
 . https://galleryrouteone.org
