BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T170000
UID:260430gFCEz3C9nE6a1jTYH00crw
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bachata Beginners Thursday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T193000
UID:26031737fpQxFdWEqrA2720_TeLQ
DESCRIPTION:Your First Steps into Bachata\n\nThis class is perfect for bac
 hata beginners that want to learn basic steps and skills\, or those who wa
 nt to refresh their foundational skills. We understand that learning somet
 hing new can feel a little intimidating. That’s why our supportive and r
 elaxed environment is specifically designed to make learning bachata basic
 s an absolute blast!\n\nOur friendly instructors will guide you through:\n
 \n**Basic directional steps:** You’ll learn the fundamental movements t
 hat form the building blocks of all bachata dancing.\n\n**Proper frame for
  partner work:** Discover how to connect comfortably and effectively with
  a partner\, setting you up for smooth and enjoyable dances.\n\n**Simple t
 urn patterns:** We’ll introduce you to easy-to-follow turn patterns tha
 t will have you dancing with a partner in no time.\n\nWe’ve carefully or
 ganized our curriculum to ensure that each movement is easy to grasp and r
 emember\, building your confidence with every step. Our goal is to make le
 arning fun. Join us to learn Bachata in Marin.\n\nImportant Details\n\n**N
 o dance experience required:** Whether you’ve never danced before or it
 ’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n**No partner necessary:** C
 ome solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll have plenty of opportun
 ities to dance.\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoe soles:** This helps us
  keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nCome join us and discover the
  joy of bachata! We can’t wait to see you on the dance floor.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/bachata-beginners/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
