UID:2610054RhUdEwXlU2glO1knlNxvg
DESCRIPTION:The Okay Ultras are a trio of powerhouse femme vocalists out o
 f Sonoma County. All three\, Ellie James\, Sophia Kandler\, and Sunny Mitc
 hell have been captivated by music and live performance all their lives! T
 hat love brought them together forging a friendship with their shared pass
 ion at the center. Together\, these three friends bring an unforgettable n
 ight of music sure to delight any audience. $17 advance AT THE DOOR $22 \\
