DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T230000
UID:261020b6PhSjCgwkOw1t-HOvaqkA
DESCRIPTION:A recovered signal. A sealed facility. One night of clearance.
 \n\nEnter Area 51: The Mercy Incident\, an immersive Halloween experience 
 where a classified alien experiment has gone very\, very wrong.\n\nA recov
 ered spacecraft. Extraterrestrial research. A mysterious lab leak. And a c
 ontainment protocol that may not hold until the end of the night.\n\nRepor
 t to the perimeter checkpoint. Present your identification. Receive your c
 learance. Then enter the facility and discover what happened inside.\n\nCL
 ASSIFIED ACCESS GRANTED FOR ONE NIGHT ONLY.\n\n🛸 Immersive Area 51 expe
 rience\n\n👽 Live encounters & unexpected discoveries\n\n📸 Cinematic 
 photo moments\n\n🎶 Live music\n\n🌿 Cannabis tastings\, brand activat
 ions\, and goodie bags\n\n🎃 Costume contest\n\nFACILITY EFFECTS\n\nThis
  immersive event may include fog/haze\, flashing lights\, loud audio\, and
  confined scenic environments.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\n
 EVENT TERMS & CONDITIONS\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-iss
 ued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at the Mercy Wellnes
 s Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recording may take p
 lace. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and p
 romotional purposes across various channels\, without compensation. Ticket
 s are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, timing\, or 
 programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to d
 esignated areas and must comply with all applicable local and state regula
 tions. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to
  comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/area51halloweenparty
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
