BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:21+ Halloween Bash
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T020000
UID:2609305YqxEzponEC9FXd2zuNrHA
DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday October 30th\n\nTime: 10:00pm-2:00am\n\nDoors Ope
 n at 9:00pm\n\nNo Entry After 11:30pm\n\nAges 21+. Valid IDs Required Upon
  Entry.\n\nGet ready for the ultimate Halloween experience at Poppy Bank E
 picenter's fifth annual 21+ Halloween Bash!\n\nWe're shutting down early t
 o throw the biggest Halloween party in Northern California\, and you won't
  want to miss it.\n\nDoors open at 9:00pm at the Chuck's/Victory House ent
 rance. Due to the sheer size of the event\, we recommend that you arrive e
 arly so you can get the party started as soon as possible!\n\nThis electri
 fying night features three dance floors and three DJs mixing different kin
 ds of music.\n\nThe main dance floor inside Red Eye Barbecue will be pumpi
 ng out everyone's favorite top hits\, mixed by DJ Sykwidit. With a full ba
 r boasting 24 taps\, you'll be two-stepping with a drink in hand all night
 .\n\nDJ Famous Amos will be spinning the hottest Latin tracks inside of Ch
 uck's Bowling. Hit the Chuck's dance floor and enjoy convenient drink acce
 ss from Chuck's full bar. Grab a bowling lane with your crew and have some
  fun!\n\nBOWLING SPECIAL | 5 Frame Bowling for $5/person (shoes are includ
 ed)\n\nSwitch it up and check out DJ Willie inside of Game-On Arcade\, whe
 re he'll be spinning Latin House Music all night long. DJ Willie is known 
 to keep the energy on the dance floor high with his Latin beats. With over
  100 arcade games\, including Laser Tag and the XD Dark Ride\, there will 
 be plenty of activities to keep you entertained!\n\nThis is a costume part
 y and we encourage everyone to dress to impress—who knows\, you might ev
 en get a surprise gift from one of our staff if your costume stands out! N
 o weapons of any kind (including props) or full face coverings are allowed
  for safety reasons.\n\nWith three DJs\, multiple bars\, bowling\, arcade 
 games\, costumes and more\, this is the Halloween party of the year. Get r
 eady to turn up with 700+ fellow Halloween party-goers at our sixth annual
  21+ Halloween Bash!\n\nTICKET INFORMATION\n\nPresale: $25\n\n• Entry in
 to the event\n\nPresale + Arcade Special: $65\n\n• Entry into the event\
 n\n• 225 Chip Arcade Game Card\n\n• One round of Laser Tag\n\n• One 
 round of XD Dark Ride\n\nIMPORTANT EVENT POLICIES:\n\n\\*Valid ID's Requir
 ed In order to consume alcoholic beverages\, you must establish that you a
 re at least 21 years of age.\n\nWe accept the following Identification for
  the purchase of alcohol per Alcohol Beverage Control standards: - State i
 ssued driver license. - State Issued Identification card. - Passport or pa
 ssport card. - Military ID.\n\nLegally acceptable identification is one ca
 rd that contains these six characteristics: - Issued by a U.S. government 
 agency (federal\, state\, county\, or city) - Name of the person - Date of
  birth - Photograph - Physical description (height\, weight\, hair\, and e
 ye color) - Currently valid (not expired)\n\nWe do not accept the followin
 g forms of identification for the purchase of alcohol: - Foreign driver li
 cense/identification card - U.S. Government Immigrant identification card 
 - Birth Certificate - School or work identification card - Identification 
 issued by a non-government agency - Social Security card - Interim or temp
 orary driver license or receipt for license from DMV - Check cashing card 
 - Otherwise valid document that in our discretion is expired\, damaged\, a
 ltered\, borrowed\, stolen\, counterfeit\, or forged\n\n\\*No bags allowed
 . Small handbags are allowed but are subjected to search.\n\n\\*No smoking
  on the premises\, including vaporizers and electronic cigarettes.\n\n\\*N
 o loitering. Loitering on theses premises or in the adjacent parking areas
  is strictly prohibited. If you are caught drinking in the parking lot you
  will be asked to leave the premises.\n\n\\*No in-and-outs. Once you leave
  the event you may not re-enter. This prevents unwanted activity from happ
 ening in our parking lots.\n\n\\*No outside food and beverage is allowed i
 nside of Poppy Bank Epicenter.\n\nPoppy Bank Epicenter\n\n3215 Coffey Ln\,
  Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95403\n\ninfo@visitepicenter.com
LOCATION:Poppy Bank Epicenter
URL:https://www.sevenrooms.com/events/victoryhouse/evnnt
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
