BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dead Man's Dinner
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T230000
UID:260911GvSHhosF7ECs4zlY0iJCRA
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the mist lies a secret devil's den where outlaws\, harl
 ots\, and the scalliest of wags gather to feast under the autumn sky.\n\nS
 tep through the ivy-covered gates and into the sumptuous sanctuary of Dead
  Man’s Dinner—an immersive evening of decadent dining and world-class 
 cabaret just in time for Halloween weekend.\n\n​For one night only\, be 
 transported to a hidden heathen's haven\, alive with flickering candles an
 d shadowed walkways while distant murmurs fill the air. As the veil thins 
 and Mischief Night unfolds\, you’ll gather under the stars and indulge i
 n a lavish feast paired with bespoke craft spirits while roving scoundrels
  and spellbinding burlesque unfold all around you.\n\nOne part secret soci
 ety. One part dinner theater. A wholly unforgettable experience: Dead Man
 ’s Dinner invites you to leave the modern world behind and join the Capt
 ain’s Court for one extraordinary night inspired by pirate mythos\, dark
  fairytales\, and maritime lore.\n\nTickets go on sale on Tuesday\, Septem
 ber 1st\, 2026. Capacity for this immersive experience is limited.\n\nDi
 nner items and signature cocktail menu to be announced.\n\nFor questions a
 nd inquiries regarding Dead Man's Dinner\, please call: \\(213\\) 650-0803
  or email us at deadmansledger@gmail.com
LOCATION:Boho Manor
URL:http://www.deadmansdinner.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
