DESCRIPTION:Weeeee'reeeeee baaaaaaack again for year 7 of our super fun Co
 tati Candyland Halloween Trick or Treat event!\n\nJoin us on Halloween for
  a FREE\, safe and fun trick or treating adventure through Cotati! We're p
 artnering with different Cotati and local businesses to hand out candy and
  treats.\n\nMeet us at the headquarters booth in La Plaza Park for a map o
 f all stops and then choose your own trick or treat adventure!\n\nRegistra
 tion not required. Free to all.\n\nAre you a business who wants to partici
 pate? If so\, please email awilson@cotaticity.gov or call 707-665-4222.
