BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trick-or-Treat Flight + Live Music by Adam Lieb
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T170000
UID:2610133D03HYntgEOAoKmjGhr-lA
DESCRIPTION:Kick off Halloween night with us! Our Saturday Live Music & Ta
 sting Experience is getting dressed up for the occasion. Come in costume \
 \(or don't\, we won't judge\\)\, sip our Reserve Tasting Flight paired wit
 h a little something sweet\, and grab a glass of witches' brew from the gi
 ant cauldron bubbling in the tasting room. Everyone's welcome\, ghouls and
  goblins included.\n\nThe Treat\n\nOur $40 Reserve Tasting Flight of six a
 ward-winning wines\, each paired with a hand-picked Halloween candy. Wine 
 club members receive up to 4 complimentary flights per visit\, depending o
 n membership level.\n\nWitches' Brew\n\nOur autumn sangria\, served straig
 ht from the cauldron. $10 a glass \\(21\\+\\).\n\nFeatured Performance\n\n
 Adam Lieb takes the stage for a special Halloween set. Adam Lieb delivers 
 music infused with passion\, craftsmanship\, and deep cultural roots. A Br
 ooklyn native now based in Northern California\, Adam’s dynamic performa
 nces — whether solo or with his Disorderly House Band — showcase a lif
 etime of musical exploration\, from touring with Robert Fripp’s League o
 f Crafty Guitarists to recording at Abbey Road Studios.\n\nDetails\n\nWalk
 -ins are welcome\, but priority seating goes to wine club members and gues
 ts with reservations. Halloween fills up fast\, so book your table. No out
 side food\, but we're dog and family friendly \\(costumed pups strongly en
 couraged\\). For groups of 13 or more\, email visit@spicyvines.com.\n\nOr 
 visit https://spicyvines.com/event/ for more info!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/trick-or-treat-flight-live-music-by-adam
 -lieb/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
