DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series: Reed Tollefson of  Audubon Califor
 nia Kern Preserve joins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a tal
 k about birds of the Kern River Preserve. The conservation dinner series i
 s complimentary to all dinner guests. If you want to attend this presentat
 ion\, please call our reservations team at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\)
  616-2695 and they can book it for you. Dinner starts at 7:00 PM.
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://safariwest.org/calendar/safari-west-presents-audubon-californi
 a-kern-preserve/
