BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Guajirón
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T170000
UID:261020Pb6h-yxRl0yAyA61CPxx9A
DESCRIPTION:Guajirón is a nine-piece Cuban dance band from San Francisco
 ’s Mission District\, playing Son\, Charanga\, Guaracha\, Boleros and Tr
 opical Jazz. We bring high-energy\, positive grooves that get you moving a
 nd leave your worries behind. \n\nFormed in 2023 with musicians from Cuba\
 , Brazil\, Italy\, the Philippines and California\, our punchy arrangement
 s reinvent beloved Cuban classics that have been making people feel good s
 ince the 1930s\, in the Caribbean\, Latin America and beyond.\n\nEvery sho
 w is different\, from dance heavy hot salsa parties\, to good-time grooves
  anyone can move to\, to thoughtful and inspiring Tropical and Cuban Jazz.
LOCATION:Downtown First Thursday
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108839271?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
