BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marin School of the Arts presents Ride the Cyclone (Teen Edition)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T210000
UID:261020Ha0pv9vcfE6hyBCwbwkL6g
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to Ride the Cyclone!\n\nFunny\, wildly original\, un
 expectedly moving\, and just a little bit twisted\, Ride the Cyclone is th
 e cult-hit musical that has become a phenomenon with audiences around the 
 world. When six members of a high school choir meet an untimely end in a r
 oller coaster accident\, they awaken in a strange carnival limbo where a m
 ysterious fortune-telling machine offers them an impossible chance: one of
  them can return to life. To decide who deserves the second chance\, each 
 must tell their story in a bizarre\, hilarious\, and heartfelt competition
  unlike anything you’ve seen before.
LOCATION:Novato High School Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/marin-school-of-the-art
 s-presents-ride-the-cyclone-teen-edition/19953644/2026-11-07T19
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
