DESCRIPTION:Join Joseph Phelps Vineyards for an immersive exploration of t
 he natural connection between forest and vine. Led by a local mycologist a
 nd Executive Chef Tod Kawachi\, this three-hour experience begins with a g
 uided foraging expedition across the estate\, uncovering the role of fungi
  in soil health and vine vitality. The experience culminates in a communal
  harvest lunch featuring seasonal mushrooms\, thoughtfully paired with the
  winery’s Freestone Pinot Noir collection. Prepaid reservations for part
 ies of 2 to 6 are available on Saturday\, November 7th and Sunday\, Novemb
 er 8th for $375 per person. Availability is limited.
