BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holistic Horse Training in Heart and Mind Equine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T103000
UID:2610127Je9AWQm30u-0ry9R3kU6g
DESCRIPTION:Bring your horse or learn with the Heart & Mind Equine herd in
  this hands-on exploration of communication\, connection\, and kind leader
 ship.\n\nOffered by Heart & Mind Equine Rescue. Meet our rescued therapy h
 orses\, explore our volunteer program\, and learn about holistic horse kee
 ping and equine-assisted services \\(e.g.\, therapy\, coaching\, leadershi
 p\, and team building with horses\\). No experience is necessary. All are 
 welcome\, including both horse and mental health professionals.\n\nA Diffe
 rent Approach to Horse Training\n\nWhat happens when we stop thinking abou
 t horse training simply as getting a horse to do what we want and start le
 arning to communicate in a language horses naturally understand?\n\nJoin u
 s for a 90-minute experiential introduction to Holistic Horse Training wit
 h lifelong horsewoman and equine-assisted learning facilitator Alane Freun
 d.\n\nHorses naturally communicate through movement\, energy\, boundaries\
 , responsiveness\, and connection. Their herd relationships include both l
 eadership and following\, with every member playing an important role.\n\n
 Alane describes these dynamics as ranking and linking: leadership in servi
 ce of relationship\, paired with the connection that makes relationship po
 ssible.\n\nHolistic Horse Training uses this deeper understanding of herd 
 dynamics to help us communicate with horses through leadership that is cle
 ar\, kind\, respectful\, and connected.\n\nWhat You’ll Learn\n\nAlane wi
 ll draw from natural horsemanship\, TTouch\, equine behavior and herd dyna
 mics\, and her own Holistic Horse Training exercises to explore:\n\nReadin
 g equine communication and body language\n\nClear\, kind boundaries\n\nLea
 dership without force\n\nBuilding trust and connection\n\nPractical traini
 ng tools and techniques\n\nWhat horses can teach us about effective leader
 ship in our own lives\n\nBring Your Horse or Learn With the Herd\n\nHave a
  horse you’d like to work with? Bring them along.\n\nNo horse? No proble
 m. You can participate with members of the Heart & Mind Equine herd.\n\nCo
 me ready to learn\, experiment\, ask questions\, and discover a more conne
 cted way of working with horses.\n\nHeart and Mind Equine | Woodacre\, CA 
 | Saturday\, November 7 • Starts at 9 AM
LOCATION:Heart and Mind Equine
URL:https://areyouhighlysensitive.thrivecart.com/heart-mind-equine-holisti
 c-horse-training/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
