 7 – Gunsight Rock at Sugarloaf/Hood Mountain Regional Park. 6.44 miles\,
  2\,129 ft. elevation (meet at Sugarloaf Ridge State Park).\n\nSun. Nov. 1
 5 – Sonoma Ridge in Sonoma Developmental Center/Jack London. 9.67 miles\
