UID:261007BSLJeLp0SUKgDjXarrhEqg
DESCRIPTION:Experience the premier wine tasting of SORBET with 20\\+ Sonom
 a Valley winegrowers and producers at Fort Mason’s Gallery 308 on Novemb
 er 8th. \n\n\n\nJoin 20\\+ Sonoma Valley winegrowers and producers at Fort
  Mason’s Gallery 308 on November 8th\, 2026 for an unforgettable afterno
 on of progressive farming practices and wine tasting. With over 2000 acres
  of Sonoma Valley vineyards now dedicated to organic\, biodynamic\, or reg
 enerative practices\, the Sonoma stands at the forefront of progressive wi
 negrowing on a global scale. \n\nThe first ever Sonoma Organic Regenerativ
 e Biodynamic Educational Tasting \\(aka S.O.R.B.E.T.\\) offers attendees t
 he opportunity to taste with producers and learn more about the future-foc
 used farming techniques that have become synonymous with the world-class w
 ines of Sonoma Valley. \n\nDiscount tickets available with the code ICYSOR
 BET \\($15 Discount\\) \n\nGET TICKETS \n\nGallery 308\n\n2 Marina Bouleva
 rd \n\nSan Francisco\, CA 94123
LOCATION:Gundland Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/sorbet-tasting-2026/
