DESCRIPTION:Each week we&\\#39\;re proudly showcasing delicious specials b
 y Rosie&\\#39\;s Bread n&\\#39\; Butter\, including their irresistible Bir
 ria tacos.\n\nPicture tender\, slow-cooked beef\, perfectly seasoned and n
