DESCRIPTION:Hestan Napa is hosting an intimate\, one-night dinner featurin
 g women-led and owned Napa wineries\, paired with an unforgettable six-cou
 rse menu curated by Hestan Napa’s Executive Chef Mark Dommen. The event 
 will kick off with an initial\, hour-long wine reception followed by a sea
 ted six-course dinner prepared by Chef Dommen\, each course crafted though
 tfully to complement its wine pairing. Eight wines will be served\, and wi
 nemakers and owners from the featured estates will join guests to present 
 their wines. Hestan Napa is thrilled to partner with Women for WineSense t
 o celebrate a selection of Napa’s “hidden jewel” women winemakers an
 d Chef Dommen’s innovative\, farm-to-table offerings.
