BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FLAMENCO! LIVE! Saturday\, November 14th at The Big Easy Petaluma 
 USA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T164500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T200000
UID:261018eWREY9Q4YkuwZRmTUkbxyg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intoxicating evening of fiery flamenco performa
 nces when FLAMENCO! LIVE! sets the stage on fire with the fury and passion
  of Spain's legendary Gypsies (Roma) with a Flamenco Dinner Show in the in
 timate atmosphere of THE BIG EASY. EXPERIENCE flamenco as stirring dances\
 , blazing guitars\, and soulful singing will transport you to another plac
 e and time.\n\nThis month we are introducing to Sonoma County Dancers Ange
 la Arteritano and Devon LaRussa! We are excited to have them here for the 
 first time! Come and check it out for yourselves. FEEL the HEAT...\n\n***F
 LAMENCO!***\n\n***LIVE!***\n\n**Saturday\, November 14th 2026**\n\nRoberto
  Zamora ~ Singer\n\nMark Taylor ~ Guitarist\n\nand introducing ~\n\nAngela
  Arteritano ~ Dancer\n\nDevon LaRussa ~ Dancer\n\ny "La Fibi" Canta un poq
 uito\n\nShowtime: 6 pm\n\nDoors: 5 pm\n\nStill only $25\n\nPay at the Door
  Cash or Card\n\nat\n\nThe Big Easy\n\nClub and Restaurant\n\n128 American
  Alley\n\nPetaluma USA\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nFlamenco Shows ever
 y OTHER Month!\n\nThe 2nd Saturday of the Month.\n\nAlways different Artis
 ts.\n\nAlways a different Show.\n\nFlamenco Dinner Show with delicious foo
 d and a Full Bar are available\, not included in entrance fee.\n\nArrive e
 arly\, get a good table and enjoy the food! Line forms at 4:45 pm\n\n\\*Li
 mited Reservations available for parties of 5 - 6 or more.\n\nCall at: (70
 7) 774- 9072\n\n\\*Large fully ventilated restaurant\, plenty of room for 
 spacing\, masks optional.\n\nFLAMENCO! LIVE! was envisioned\, conceived\, 
 and has thrived since 2002 in Sonoma County\, California\, now celebrating
  24 years! Presenting the collaborative efforts of the Bay Area's finest F
 lamenco Singers\, Guitarists and Dancers\, and supporting local Flamenco s
 tudents\, dreamers\, and talents\, our goal has been to present top-notch 
 performances. Phoebe Vernier "La Fibi" has brought decades of artistry and
  energy to the public of Sonoma County for the purpose of sharing the musi
 c\, song and dance\, the treasure of Southern Spain. Whether in the formal
  theater or in a casual setting\, the respect\, purity\, and integrity of 
 this traditional\, yet living and evolving art form is always foremost.\n\
 nNow in our 25th Year of fiery Flamenco Shows in Sonoma County!\n\nThis pe
 rformance is underwritten by the generous support of "The Circle of Sponso
 rs"\, a group of flamenco music\, song and dance Aficionados from Sonoma C
 ounty\, California and Nationwide that believe in the power of local art t
 o heal and inspire our community and world. Thank you so much\, Sponsors!\
 n\n"Best Performing Dance Company" - The Northbay Bohemian's BEST of the N
 orthbay!
LOCATION:The Big Easy Club and Restaurant
URL:https://flamencolive.weebly.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
