BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with Zoë Lewis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T210000
UID:261016DCJYLoxsOU-4xVMj9o5ZmA
DESCRIPTION:Affectionately know as “a band in a body\,” Zoë Lewis pla
 ys vintage jazz and world beat grooves on anything from the piano to ukul
 ele to the spoons! \n\nOriginally from the UK\, this astonishing singer-s
 ongwriter has called Provincetown her home for the last 32 years. She's tr
 aveled to over 70 countries picking up musical grooves and stories along t
 he way\, released ten albums of original material\, toured with the Indigo
  Girls\, Judy Collins\, Richie Havens\, Nanci Griffiths and has even opene
 d for Pat Benatar on the ukulele! \n\nHer songs have won numerous accolad
 es\, have appeared in films\, on Broadway\, in commercials\, and most rece
 ntly on the Netflix kid show StoryBots. She’s written 3 musicals that re
 ceived rave reviews\, performs for OLIVIA cruises\, and takes her show to 
 Puerto Vallarta\, Mexico every winter.\n\nZoe will be joined by the fabulo
 us KATE WOLF on bass.\n\nAn evening with Zoe Lewis will leave you with lon
 g-lasting joy. Join us!
LOCATION:Congregation Ner Shalom
URL:https://www.nershalom.org/event-calendar/2026/11/14-zoe-lewis
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
