BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STIMULANT: Art as Remedy for Diseased Culture\, Exhibition and Eve
 nts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T160000
UID:261021Ia01_I1_bE6GaTbeelaf3Q
DESCRIPTION:In a diseased society with failing systems\, what can we do to
  turn things around? For two weeks a new exhibition from Sonoma County’s
  own Apocalypse Studio\, a father and daughter artist duo\, STIMULANT: Ar
 t as Remedy for Diseased Culture proposes that art is the antidote and cr
 eativity is the countermove. This exhibition explores the inner and outer 
 work of co-creating that antidote: art that stimulates society’s creativ
 ity - the social sculpture we all create together. There will be two perfo
 rmances\, two lectures\, a Parisian -style Art Salon\, and times to visit 
 the large exhibition and talk with the artists. All events are free to at
 tend. Visit www.apocalypse.art/stimulant for details and schedule of event
 s.
LOCATION:Laguna Lab
URL:https://apocalypse.art/stimulant/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
